 </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">6</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">The Gift: </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">4</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">WP</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">9</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">0</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">m) </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">15</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">i</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Ganan: </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">4</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">WP</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">m) 1</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">i </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">a </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Earth Aura </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(3B) </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-1 Wound Penalty</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Reya: </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">WP</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (13/26m) </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">2</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">a Air Aura </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">7</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">i</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> S</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">hort </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Range</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Nula: </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">4WP </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">12</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">/</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">21</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">m) 4i Long Range </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">14</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">sm</span